[stderr] +| F19 | typed: canonical `Málaga`; aliases `Malaga` | `Malagaa` | ✗ | One extra character is not fuzzy-matched. |
[stderr] +| F20 | typed: canonical `Málaga`; aliases `Malaga` | `Malaga City` | ✗ | Unconfigured expansion is not inferred. |
