[stderr] +| F10 | true/false: `true` | `TRUE` | ! | Boolean IDs are case-sensitive opaque IDs. |
[stderr] +| F11 | ordered pair: `[club-a, club-b]` | `[club-a, club-b]` | ✓ | Ordered canonical IDs match. |
[stderr] +| F12 | ordered pair: `[club-a, club-b]` | `[club-b, club-a]` | ✗ | Same members in wrong sequence. |
[stderr] +| F13 | ordered pair: `[club-a, club-b]` | `[club-a]` | ! | Pair arity is not two. |
[stderr] +| F14 | ordered pair: `[club-a, club-b]` | `[club-a, club-b, club-c]` | ! | Pair arity is not two. |
[stderr] +| F15 | ordered pair: `[club-a, club-b]` | `[Club A, Club B]` | ! | Display labels are not IDs. |
[stderr] +| F16 | typed: canonical `Málaga`; aliases `Malaga` | `  MÁLAGA  ` | ✓ | NFKD/casefold/trim yields `malaga`. |
[stderr] +| F17 | typed: canonical `Málaga`; aliases `Malaga` | `Málaga!` | ✓ | Punctuation becomes a trimmed separator. |
[stderr] +| F18 | typed: canonical `Łódź`; aliases `Lodz` | `LODZ` | ✓ | Explicit `ł` mapping plus diacritic removal yields `lodz`. |
[stderr] +| F19 | typed: canonical `Málaga`; aliases `Malaga` | `Malagaa` | ✗ | One extra character is not fuzzy-matched. |
[stderr] +| F20 | typed: canonical `Málaga`; aliases `Malaga` | `Malaga City` | ✗ | Unconfigured expansion is not inferred. |
